# score: Las Vocales del Telar
# summary: GARGANTA rung 1 — bowed strings wearing vowel bodies; the instrument's first syllables
# tempo: 63
# time: 3/4
# key: Dm
# bars: 22
# reverb: 1.8
# master: rms=-15

# text @b1: a bowed string wearing /a/, then /e/, /i/, /o/, /u/ — the
# text @b1: five mouths of one string. no samples, no voice but the loom's.
# text @b9: two voices in thirds, vowels changing against each other.
# text @b17: the chord that says "aiu".

